&lt;p&gt;As we establish our India Engineering Center of Excellence (COE), we are looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Engineering Manager&lt;/strong&gt; who can lead and grow the Web Platform team. As the Engineering Manager for the Web Platform team, you will be expected to lead a team of experienced software engineers responsible for the core web application tooling and client services that support all of our web-based clients.&amp;nbsp; This includes our web application, Electron-based desktop client, browser extension, and CLI, as well as other clients and additional Products in the future.&amp;nbsp; You will be expected to work closely with other managers and teams across the organization to understand their needs for ongoing feature development, anticipate future needs, and ensure the ongoing stability and security of the platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
