&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;634&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fc34f862d71d&quot;&gt;As a Lead Software Engineer on Bitwarden’s Provider/Business Unit Portals team, you will lead the design and development of both the Provider and Business Unit Portals. The former is built to service managed service providers (MSPs) and resellers who administer Bitwarden organizations on behalf of separate, external customers. The latter is is built for a single company&#39;s own administrators to manage multiple Enterprise organizations that all belong to that same company (e.g., different business units, subsidiaries, or departments). Both portals give administrators a single, centralized experience for creating and managing multiple Bitwarden Enterprise organizations at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1320&quot; data-local-id=&quot;57c92ac2a60e&quot;&gt;This Lead Software Engineer role is &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;hands-on&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;does not carry any expectations for people management&lt;/strong&gt;. You&#39;ll stay close to the code while driving architecture, technical direction, and complex, high-impact engineering problems. As our India Product Engineering organization grows, you&#39;ll help shape its engineering practices and also navigate opportunities to mentor and elevate other engineers through technical leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
