&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1768&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b2f6189a78fa&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;End-to-End Delivery &amp;amp; Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, build, test, deploy, and operate secure, performant services and applications for the Provider and Business Unit Portals. You are accountable for these services end to end, including the parts you did not personally write.&lt;/li&gt;
