&lt;li&gt;Excellent English and grammar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving skills (you might not know all the answers but you know how to find and communicate the solutions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for supporting your team members, growing together (technical ability and emotional intelligence), and sharing your knowledge with all&lt;/li&gt;
