&lt;p&gt;The Product Design team at Bitwarden makes it simple for people of all skill levels to manage sensitive data. We give users clear options and guide them toward good security habits. We keep our experiences consistent and transparent so people can trust Bitwarden with their data and feel confident using it.&lt;/p&gt;
