&lt;li&gt;Design for difficult cases, such as multi-step logins, unusual login forms, and sites where autofill does not work as expected&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work within iOS and Android autofill frameworks and browser limitations so autofill behaves consistently on every platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help users understand when Bitwarden will and will not autofill, and why, so they can avoid phishing sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create user flows, prototypes, and production-ready designs using the Bitwarden design system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI design tools to facilitate and scale research, ideation, rapid prototyping, and iteration&lt;/li&gt;
