&lt;li&gt;Experience with Rust, particularly for cross-platform SDK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python, Splunk, or other SIEM platform experience (Datadog, Elastic, etc.) — we use Python in our Splunk app&lt;/li&gt;
