&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to troubleshoot and resolve automation-related issues in different application environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay updated with the latest automation trends and technologies to continuously improve test automation strategies and practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document test automation frameworks and processes to facilitate knowledge sharing and ensure maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide mentorship and guidance to junior team members on test automation best practices, coding standards, and frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING TO BITWARDEN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in C# programming&lt;/li&gt;
