&lt;p&gt;Bitwarden is the trusted identity security leader for millions of users worldwide, empowering enterprises, developers, and individuals to securely manage and share sensitive information anywhere. Bitwarden makes it easy for all users to extend robust security across their devices with password management, secrets management, and passwordless and passkey innovations. The company is headquartered in Santa Barbara, California. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://bitwarden.com/&quot;&gt;bitwarden.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we establish our India Engineering Center of Excellence (COE), we are looking for an experienced Staff Software Engineer.&amp;nbsp;As a Staff Software Engineer in the Architecture group at Bitwarden you will contribute directly to the future of the Bitwarden product across mobile, web, and server components while working with a great team and amazing open-source community. We’re looking for someone who can take ownership of delivering valuable features throughout the entire development lifecycle and play a direct role in shaping our products. Additionally, a team member within our Architecture group will direct and support decisions for new frameworks and technical strategy across all domains and engineering teams. This person operates at a level of accountability and responsibility where they are independently-driven and have shown a propensity to find and work through solutions on a regular basis, mentoring others along the way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become an expert and authority on the Bitwarden codebase, including: backend infrastructure, APIs, database, web app, mobile apps, browser extensions, desktop apps, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in hands-on development of the Bitwarden product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate clearly and effectively with all levels of the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shepherd development activities from the idea phase to execution, assisting all teams via code and architectural review, community engagement, demonstration of new work, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Occasionally contribute bug fixes or shepherd pull requests submitted by the user community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take lead on new areas of desired product investment and deliver proof-of-concept or minimum-viable projects, along with handoff to domain teams for eventual ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own systems-level documentation and advocate for effective documentation at all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a point of technical escalation and knowledge to help resolve issues and technical hurdles the team may encounter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and coach other teams through solution design and implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for and on behalf of the development and delivery of Bitwarden’s product, process, and organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience working in some or all of our stack (.NET Core with C#, JavaScript / TypeScript, Angular, Docker, Azure, SQL Server or similar RDBMS)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency using source control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and adaptable mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Openness and authenticity combined with excellent communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excitement and enthusiasm for helping customers solve security and password challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving skills – you might not know all the answers but you know how to find and communicate the solution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zeal for learning and desire to develop yours and your peers’ skills in software development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to play a foundational role in shaping our India Engineering COE from the ground up.&amp;nbsp;Our user community loves us and we love them. Come to work each day with a sense of purpose as we bring a more secure internet experience to everyone from our friends and family to the world’s largest organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Become an expert. You’ll get immersed in the prominent technology markets of security and open source software. You&#39;ll work alongside talented global teams, solve meaningful engineering challenges, influence how we scale our engineering organization &amp;amp; contribute to products used by customers around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re passionate about building exceptional teams, enabling engineering excellence, and making a lasting impact within a fast-growing engineering company, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to fostering an inclusive workplace where everyone can do their best work. We welcome applicants from all backgrounds and make employment decisions based on skills, experience, qualifications, and business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;p-pdf_viewer_thumbnail&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-number=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;VP, Channel &amp;amp; Strategic Partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bitwarden | Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bitwarden is scaling its global partner ecosystem, and we&#39;re hiring a VP of Channel &amp;amp; Strategic Partnerships to own it. This leader will build and drive our worldwide channel strategy across resellers, distributors, MSPs/MSSPs, cloud marketplaces, and strategic alliances, turning partners into a primary engine of new business. Reporting to the CRO, you&#39;ll set the vision, build the team, and deliver partner-originated revenue at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the global channel strategy and number, delivering partner-sourced and partner-influenced revenue in a high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale the channel organization from its current stage into a mature, repeatable engine, evolving partner programs, tiering, and operating cadence as the business grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, recruit, and enable a high-performing channel organization across the Americas and EMEA, expanding headcount and coverage as the business scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and scale relationships with VARs, VADs, and distribution partners across international markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow the MSP and MSSP motion, including program structure, margin models, and recurring-revenue partner economics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Cloud Service Provider partnerships and marketplace strategy, including AWS Marketplace and Microsoft Azure Marketplace, to accelerate co-sell motions and consumption-based growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and expand strategic alliance partnerships (technology, ISV, and cloud) to extend reach and create joint value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design partner program tiers, incentives, deal registration, and co-selling frameworks that drive predictable growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Direct Sales, Marketing, and Product to align the channel motion with GTM priorities and avoid conflict.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own partner performance analytics: pipeline coverage, partner-sourced pipeline, win rates, and ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years in channel and partnership sales, including 5+ years in senior channel leadership roles building and running multi-region teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of scaling a channel organization, taking a partner program from early or mid-stage to a mature, predictable revenue contributor (e.g., growing partner-originated revenue to 25%+ of new bookings).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International channel experience spanning VARs and VADs across multiple regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep MSP and MSSP experience, including building and scaling recurring-revenue partner programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud Service Provider and marketplace experience, including AWS Marketplace and Microsoft Azure Marketplace co-sell and listing motions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong alliance and strategic partnership experience (technology/ISV/cloud).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building, structuring, and leading distributed, multi-region channel teams through periods of rapid growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive-level communication and cross-functional leadership skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cybersecurity or security software experience strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel internationally as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
